  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>装备<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>技能时，击杀受<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span><span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>（<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>、<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>、<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span>）影响的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>生成一枚<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>。<br> <br> <span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>元素拾取物，是一个构造体，有 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 点<span class=\"health\">生命值</span>，最多存在 20 秒；5 米内可以拾取，最多持有 20 秒。<br> 生成后有 12 秒冷却，冷却结束前无法生成更多。<br> 攻击它或把它投出去都会引爆，在 8 米半径内造成 346 <span class=\"pvp\">[100]</span> 伤害；两种方式都计为一次元素交互。<br> 用<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>钩住<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>会完全返还<span class=\"pickup\">手雷能量</span>并把使用者拉过去。</p>", "hash": "trait:1577394840", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/b879741c89.webp", "kind": "效果", "name": "缠结", "q": "缠结"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>只与<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>交互的<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>等价物，<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>时表现与普通<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>一致。<br> <br> 最长持续 20 秒，每次<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>刷新 5 秒；无法被摧毁，也无法拾取。<br> 瞄准 27 米（装备<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>手雷时 32 米）内的<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩缠结</span>，会在 0.3 秒内把手雷技能覆盖为非攻势<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>。<br> <span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>与<span class=\"el-prismatic\">棱镜</span>分支职业允许使用<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>近战；<span class=\"el-prismatic\">棱镜</span>术士需要装备<span class=\"el-strand\">神秘织针</span>才能用。<br> <span class=\"note\">连续 5 次抓取同一枚抓钩缠结后，刷新量降到 1 秒。</span></p>", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/22406e20bf.webp", "kind": "效果", "name": "抓钩缠结", "q": "抓钩缠结"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p><span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>召唤物，追逐 <span class=\"unsure\">20?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>，在 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内跃向目标。<br> <br> 接触或跃起后爆炸，在小范围内最多造成 366 <span class=\"pvp\">[35]</span> 伤害。<br> 接触前丢失目标的<span class=\"el-strand\">线虫</span>会落地另寻<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>，而不是自爆。<br> <span class=\"el-strand\">线虫</span>的伤害计入其生成来源，但一旦停栖就失去这层继承关系。<br> <br> 术士互动：<br> 未开始追踪<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>的<span class=\"el-strand\">线虫</span>飞行 14 米后返回并停栖，最多 5 只。<br> 造成武器伤害或近战命中时逐只释放，每次释放间隔 0.5 秒。<br> 以这种方式释放的<span class=\"el-strand\">线虫</span>可以在任意射程追踪。</p>", "hash": "trait:2724747993", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/9753dd3b68.webp", "kind": "效果", "name": "线虫", "q": "线虫"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>提供 45% <span class=\"pvp\">[25%]</span> 伤害抗性，持续 10 秒。<br> <span class=\"note\">来自守护者的精准命中与近战攻击无视这层抗性。</span><br> <br> 施放任意超能技能时<span class=\"el-strand\">织造铠甲</span>被移除。</p>", "hash": "trait:3173573497", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/742d37444f.webp", "kind": "效果", "name": "织造铠甲", "q": "织造铠甲"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p><span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成的伤害降低 40% <span class=\"pvp\">[15%]</span>，持续 10+5 <span class=\"pvp\">[5+2.5]</span> 秒。</p>", "hash": "trait:2519102437", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/f74fd71921.webp", "kind": "效果", "name": "割裂", "q": "割裂"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>被<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>无法移动、射击或使用技能。<br> <span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span>与<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span>最多被<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span> 6+2 秒，<span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>只有 3+1 秒。<br> <span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span>不受<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>效果阻挡，1 秒后挣脱，改为受到 300 <span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝伤害</span>；尽管如此，这段时间内它仍视为带着<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span><span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>。<br> 被<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>的<span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>被抬到空中，可以缓慢水平悬浮并腰射武器，持续 2+1 秒，视角切到第三人称。<br> <span class=\"enemy\">势不可挡勇士</span>被<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>时进入<span class=\"enemy\">眩晕</span>。</p>", "hash": "trait:2679722414", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/b18acd6942.webp", "kind": "效果", "name": "悬停", "q": "悬停"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>被<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>在受到 40 点伤害后 0.25 秒释放 3 条追踪线，飞向 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>。<br> 每条线造成 26 <span class=\"pvp\">[4]</span> 伤害并在命中时施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span>。<br> 两次释放之间有 1.2 秒冷却。<br> 线命中会把<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span>的持续时间刷新回它原本的长度——若来源施加的是 9 秒，命中就重置回 9 秒。</p>", "hash": "trait:945613349", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/7d532f89f7.webp", "kind": "效果", "name": "瓦解", "q": "瓦解"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p><span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>武器造成伤害时施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span>。</p>", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/a2e8c19bf6.webp", "kind": "效果", "name": "瓦解弹药", "q": "瓦解弹药"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">+10 武器</p><p>使用手雷技能补满已准备的武器，并提供 <span class=\"unsure\">+40?</span> 操控性、+40 填装速度、换弹时长 ×0.925 与 +30 空中效率，持续 15 秒。<br> <span class=\"note\">激活后每次补弹之间有 4 秒冷却。</span></p>", "hash": "4208512216", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/87a87f9d87.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "上升丝线", "q": "上升丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">+10 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></p><p>超能击杀使<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>触发一次<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>爆裂，在 6 米内造成 108 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害并施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>。</p>", "hash": "3192552688", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/0c2a3d6507.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "束缚丝线", "q": "束缚丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p><span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span><span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>的持续时间通常延长 50%。<br> 受影响的来源会在常规时长旁用小字标出增量。</p>", "hash": "3192552690", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/8394dd8463.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "持续丝线", "q": "持续丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">+10 超能</p><p><span class=\"el-strand\">线虫</span>移动速度提高 <span class=\"unsure\">30?</span>%，飞得更远，伤害也更高。<br> 对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span> +33%，对<span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span> +12.5%。</p>", "hash": "4208512211", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/051d772217.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "进化丝线", "q": "进化丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">+10 职业</p><p><span class=\"enemy\">终结技</span>生成<span class=\"el-strand\">线虫</span>，数量随<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>等级变化。<br> <span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span> 1 只 ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span> 2 只 ｜ <span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span> 3 只。</p>", "hash": "4208512217", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/314c9085f4.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "终局丝线", "q": "终局丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">-10 近战</p><p>用<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>造成伤害时，每次伤害实例提供一部分<span class=\"pickup\">近战能量</span>。<br> <span class=\"enemy\">T1 级战斗人员</span> 10% ｜ <span class=\"enemy\">T2</span> 18% ｜ <span class=\"enemy\">T3</span> 20% ｜ <span class=\"enemy\">T4</span> 30% ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span> 25%。<br> <span class=\"note\">两次触发之间约有 1 秒冷却。</span></p>", "hash": "4208512219", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/cbdec13d01.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "狂怒丝线", "q": "狂怒丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">-10 手雷</p><p>造成伤害时提供一部分<span class=\"pickup\">手雷技能能量</span>。<br> <span class=\"note\">回能随来源与伤害量而变，通常造成的伤害越高，回的能量越多。</span></p>", "hash": "3192552691", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/6339b0bf03.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "生成丝线", "q": "生成丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p>2 秒内连续取得多次<span class=\"stack\">精准命中</span>后，发射一次<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>爆裂，对 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>。<br> <span class=\"stack\">精准命中</span>按武器流派计数，满 100% 触发：独头霰弹枪 50% ｜ 弓箭与狙击步枪 34% ｜ 手炮与斥候步枪 25% ｜ 手枪 20% ｜ 自动步枪 15% ｜ 机枪与脉冲步枪 12% ｜ 追踪步枪与微型冲锋枪 10%。<br> <span class=\"note\">割裂后有 4 秒冷却，冷却期间的精准命中不计入。</span></p>", "hash": "3192552689", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/553302e384.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "孤立丝线", "q": "孤立丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p>击杀被<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>按等级提供<span class=\"pickup\">职业技能能量</span>。<br> <span class=\"enemy\">T1 级战斗人员</span> 10% ｜ <span class=\"enemy\">T2</span> 12% ｜ <span class=\"enemy\">T3</span> 15% ｜ <span class=\"enemy\">T4</span> 30% ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span> 15%。<br> <span class=\"note\">每次击杀后约有 1 秒冷却。</span></p>", "hash": "4208512218", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/d31001ff60.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "思维丝线", "q": "思维丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">+10 近战</p><p>充能近战技能击杀为<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>武器提供<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span>子弹，持续 8 <span class=\"pvp\">[5]</span> 秒。</p>", "hash": "4208512210", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/a2e8c19bf6.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "增殖丝线", "q": "增殖丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p><span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>武器击杀推进计数，满 100% 生成若干<span class=\"el-strand\">线虫</span>。<br> <span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span> 34%（1 只）｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span> 67%（2 只）｜ <span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>与<span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span> 100%（3 只）｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span> 67%（2 只）。</p>", "hash": "4208512220", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/5b66311b2a.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "重生丝线", "q": "重生丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">+10 近战</p><p><span class=\"el-strand\">织造铠甲</span>激活期间，武器击杀生成<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>。</p>", "hash": "4208512221", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/9efade5da9.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "蜕变丝线", "q": "蜕变丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">-10 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></p><p>拾取<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>提供<span class=\"el-strand\">织造铠甲</span>，持续 5 秒。</p>", "hash": "4208512222", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/901bc1cfcc.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "守护丝线", "q": "守护丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p>击杀被<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>生成一枚<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>，提供 2.5% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>。<br> <span class=\"note\">生成能量球后有 10 秒冷却。</span></p>", "hash": "4208512223", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/2e591f02fc.webp", "kind": "碎片", "name": "智慧丝线", "q": "智慧丝线"},
  {"anchor": "sec-3", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">基础冷却 118.7 秒<br> 回复倍率 0.875×</p><p>钩住 22 米外的目标，造成 38 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害并在接触时使<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>踉跄，同时附着到<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>或物体上。<br> 激活 1 秒内取消返还 50% <span class=\"pickup\">手雷能量</span>。<br> <br> 钩住<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>或<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩缠结</span>时：<br> 完全返还<span class=\"pickup\">抓钩技能充能</span>，并提供<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>返还持续 4 秒——<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>期间<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>结束可以立即再用。<br> <span class=\"note\">此时手雷快速启动不会激活。</span><br> <br> <span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>近战 ｜ <span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>期间，或结束后 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 秒内速度仍够快时，按［近战攻击］发动。<br> 造成 432 <span class=\"pvp\">[61]</span> 直击伤害与在 <span class=\"unsure\">4?</span> 米半径内最多 432 <span class=\"pvp\">[61]</span> 径向伤害，施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span>并把<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>推开。<br> 它同时计为手雷与近战技能。<br> <span class=\"note\">被抓钩近战直接命中的守护者近战突进失效 0.5 秒；抓钩近战配合抓钩缠结使用时，点尸成金提供的超能能量减少 50%。</span><br> <span class=\"note\">空中期间抓钩的被动技能恢复被禁用，丝线打击同理。</span><br> <br> <span class=\"el-strand\">心纺祷告</span>：<br> <span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>近战命中时生成 3 只<span class=\"el-strand\">线虫</span>。</p>", "hash": "1225978592 2470512752", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/24b726319d.webp", "kind": "手雷技能", "name": "抓钩", "q": "抓钩"},
  {"anchor": "sec-3", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">基础冷却 219.5 秒<br> 回复倍率 0.5×</p><p><span class=\"note\">捕缚球弹道</span><br> <br> 投出一枚捕缚球，受到伤害时释放爆炸，造成 190 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害并在 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米半径内对被命中的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>。<br> 随后释放更小的捕缚球——直接命中释放 2 个，接触表面则释放 3 个。<br> 更小的捕缚球射向附近<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>，每个造成 81 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害并在命中时施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>。<br> <br> <span class=\"el-strand\">心纺祷告</span>：<br> 提供织者迷境持续 25 秒；期间击杀的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>死亡时触发<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>爆炸，对 6 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成 108 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> <span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>手雷技能伤害。</p>", "hash": "1517917190 2809342386", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/bf16066e67.webp", "kind": "手雷技能", "name": "束缚手雷", "q": "束缚手雷"},
  {"anchor": "sec-3", "desc": "<p class=\"v\">基础冷却 219.5 秒<br> 回复倍率 0.5×</p><p><span class=\"note\">中型弹道</span><br> <br> 投出一枚弹跳手雷，接触后不久爆炸，在 6 米范围内造成 4 次溅射伤害并施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>，持续 10+5 秒。<br> <br> 四次爆炸最大伤害：<br> 第 1 次 178 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> ｜ 第 2 次 178 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> ｜ 第 3 次 222 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> ｜ 第 4 次 267 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span>。<br> 对任意<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>的第一次命中额外造成一次 307 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害。<br> <br> <span class=\"el-strand\">心纺祷告</span>：<br> 第四次爆炸呈 X 形释放 4 枚子弹药，每枚最多造成 64 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害并生成<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>，无视<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>的生成冷却。</p>", "hash": "1377143502", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/36f7c00ff9.webp", "kind": "手雷技能", "name": "切线手雷", "q": "切线手雷"},
