  {"anchor": "sec-5", "desc": "<p>击杀受元素<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>影响的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>提供 10% <span class=\"pickup\">职业技能能量</span>。<br> <br> 使用职业技能：<br> 释放一条<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>鞭，向前飞行最远 30 米，追踪路径上的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>，命中造成 61 <span class=\"pvp\">[31]</span> 伤害并施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>。</p>", "hash": "988980152 1262901525", "icon": "elements/strand/icons/b7bc4b447f.webp", "kind": "星相", "name": "勇士之鞭", "q": "勇士之鞭"},
